# kaneo_label

Retrieves a workspace label by ID. Missing labels, task-copy IDs, and failed lookups are errors.

## Example usage

{{ tffile "examples/data-sources/kaneo_label/data-source.tf" }}

Pass `data.kaneo_label.bug.id` to [`kaneo_task_label.label_id`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/glitchedmob/kaneo/latest/docs/resources/task_label) to attach it without managing the source label.

